---
alwaysApply: true
---

- Never hard-code secrets. Read them from Deno.env.get().
- Every table has RLS enabled. Clients never write to clips; only service-role Edge Functions do.
- Admin functions require header x-admin-token == ADMIN_TOKEN.
- Match the existing clip/token data format in README.md, supabase/schema.sql and Tools/generate_seed.py.
- Do not change existing Swift UI behavior or offline fallbacks.
- Never print or log secret values.